# AI-AGENT NOTICE: Scheduled-only interface. Use only when
# control_modes.<mode>.inference.scheduler.enable=true. Do not use on the legacy inference path.
# Goal: Scheduled action dispatch within an active session.
# request_id is a session-unique UUID4. priority is a backend-agnostic non-negative
# int32: 0 is highest priority, and larger values are lower priority. Backends expose
# their supported level count; a single-priority backend accepts only 0.
# Global applies fallback_chain and the caller deadline only when priority is 0.
# Non-zero, lower-priority requests dispatch target_pipeline_id directly under an internal timeout.
# negative rejected at Scheduler and pipeline. Zero obs_timestamp means the target
# pipeline captures its own observation clock on goal receipt.
builtin_interfaces/Time obs_timestamp
string<=4096 prompt
string<=36 request_id
string<=36 session_id
uint64 session_generation
string<=63 target_pipeline_id
string<=63[<=32] fallback_chain
builtin_interfaces/Time deadline
int32 priority
---
# Result
ibrobot_msgs/VariantsList action_chunk
int32 chunk_size
int32 execution_horizon                  # Optional executable prefix; zero means full chunk
bool success
float64 inference_latency_ms
string<=63 pipeline_id
string<=36 session_id
uint64 session_generation
string<=36 request_id
string<=64 deployment_fingerprint
string<=64 runtime_policy_fingerprint
float64 backend_latency_ms
ibrobot_msgs/InferenceOutcome outcome
ibrobot_msgs/ScheduledInferenceError error
---
# Feedback (not used for correctness)
string<=128 status
